      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "43d3e4f506172839",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**v1 — `research_only`, `deprecated`**\nAtivada 2026-09-06T03:36:36Z, depreciada 2026-09-08T04:33:56Z.\nCoorte `prospective`. Medida em [[EXP-0001-momentum-v1]]: 91 outcomes avaliáveis, **1** dia, expectancy **−0,2102 R** — **inconclusivo** pelo limiar (100 E 30).",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "54e4f50617283940",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "03-TRADING/Estrategias/momentum-v2.md",
      "x": 140,
